    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105413" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐχό-βρως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωτος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>eating hair</i>: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχόβρωτες,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῆτες</span>
			 or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρῖπες,</span>
			<i>moths,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1111
			</span></i> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχοβρῶτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					2.24
				</span></i>
			; both accents admitted by Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> l.c. (<i><span class="en">
				1110
			</span></i>)).</div>
